> | Crash after commit, before processing | Intent pending; processed after restart. |
> | Crash after admission, before outcome write | Retry replays the key → `Replayed(run)` → `admitted`. |
> | Crash after reply event, before outcome | Retry → `Duplicate` → matched; no admission. |
> | Stale worker after lease expiry | Generation-fenced writes affect zero rows; worker stops. |
> | Binding reconfigured during processing | `Stale` → re-read/re-evaluate (≤3), admit under new revision or skip if ineligible. |
> | Run-as lost admin/visibility; binding inactive; input rejected | `refused(code)` + warning + metric; siblings unaffected. |
> | One binding failing transiently | Siblings still admitted; that binding retried; `failed` after 5 attempts. |
> | Reply before the wait parks | `NotYet` → deferred until park, run end, or 5 min. |
> | Reply to unawaited send / after wait / wrong responder / second reply | `Unmatched` → ordinary admission. |
> | Tenant burst | ≤4 rows per company per page; other tenants progress. |
> | Simulation RunTest | Run and children `in_app_only`; no delivery rows. |
> | Pool too small for slots | Startup refuses with both keys named. |
